SUMMARY:Sheraton Bradley Airport - two rooms
DESCRIPTION:Confirmed for Sunday night. Hotel is connected to Terminal A; no
 hotel shuttle is needed. Standard check-in is 3:00 PM and check-out is noon.
LOCATION:1 Bradley International Airport\, Windsor Locks\, CT 06096
URL:https://www.marriott.com/en-us/hotels/bdlsi-sheraton-hartford-hotel-at-bradley-airport/overview/
