BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:arrival-20260921@pnw-family-trip
DTSTAMP:20260902T190000Z
DTSTART:20260921T190000Z
DTEND:20260921T210000Z
SUMMARY:Arrive at SEA
LOCATION:Seattle-Tacoma International Airport
DESCRIPTION:Collect bags\, then take the free 24-hour Rental Car Shuttle from
 the north or south end of the Baggage Claim lower drive. No train. Shuttle
 ride is about five minutes. Hertz Standard SUV pickup is confirmed for 1:00
 PM at the SEA Rental Car Facility. Chevrolet Blazer or similar\, five
 passengers\, 2WD. Bring the primary driver's license and Chase Sapphire
 Preferred; confirmation code is in the Hertz email. Photograph the vehicle\,
 fuel gauge\, and odometer before leaving.
URL:https://www.portseattle.org/sea/ground-transportation/rental-car
END:VEVENT
