BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:return-20260927@pnw-family-trip
DTSTAMP:20260902T190000Z
DTSTART:20260927T150000Z
DTEND:20260928T013000Z
SUMMARY:Cannon Beach, Astoria, and return Hertz SUV at SEA
DESCRIPTION:Unload passengers and luggage at the Holiday Inn Express about 5:30
 PM.
 Return the Hertz Standard SUV by 6:00 PM at 3150 S 160th St. Refuel to the
 contracted level\, retain the fuel and Hertz receipts\, and photograph the
 vehicle\, fuel gauge\, and odometer. Take the free rental-car shuttle to the
 terminal; call the Holiday Inn Express at 206-824-3200 for its 24-hour shuttle
 from parking-garage Level 3\, courtesy island 1 or 3.
LOCATION:SEA Rental Car Facility\, 3150 S 160th St\, SeaTac\, WA 98188
URL:https://www.portseattle.org/places/rental-car-facility
END:VEVENT
